\f0\fs22 Later, when morning tea had been served, Sarah drew Johnny aside and spoke quietly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f0\fs22 \'93What have the Sages to say about this?\'94\
Johnny mocked offence. \'93The who?\'94\
\'93Seven Sages Corporation. The old geezers from the Memphis Mafia Bar? They offered to get me pregnant?\'94\
\'93Yes, well, you obviously took them up on their offer.\'94\
Sarah let that slide. \'93Tell me you didn\'92t get the second disc from one of the Sages.\'94\
Johnny had been betrayed. \'93Well, he didn\'92t supply an instruction manual.\'94\
\'93No,\'94 Sarah said. \'93He didn\'92t. So you haven\'92t leaked any of this to them?\'94\
Johnny had half turned away.\
\'93I want the Sages here,\'94 Sarah told him. \'93Preferably under armed guard.\'94
